    "why": [
      "Saves 15% irrigation water (160 mm/yr \u2014 ~2 flood irrigations and 88 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 4.2 cm/yr.",
